New Features
Added a built-in Google Cloud Vertex AI provider, configured with
model_provider = "gcp"
. (
#56265
)
Added GPT-6.1 Terra to the model catalogs. (
#57337
)
Added a repository filter to the session picker and directory grouping to the agent command center, making it easier to navigate sessions across linked worktrees. (
#56308
)
Added experimental attached thread forks to the app-server API. (
#56351
)
Enabled reasoning effort changes during a conversation by default for supported models. (
#56163
)
Enabled memory v2 by default for fresh profiles and added support for importing external-agent memories into it. (
#56211
,
#56414
)
Bug Fixes
Fixed fresh TUI sessions to honor the server’s default approval reviewer when no explicit override is provided. (
#56090
)
Kept TUI preferences editable and immediately applicable when execution settings are invalid. (
#56091
)
Cancelled remote MCP tool requests when their local response futures are dropped. (
#56132
)
Prevented queued agent messages from restarting work after an interrupt or a switch to Plan mode. (
#56330
)
Stopped retrying when a provider reports that a model was not found, preserving its error message. (
#56445
)
Closed a marketplace URL validation gap that could allow Git to connect to a different host than the one checked against allowed patterns. (
#56263
)
